        "Description": "Good Afternoon 47,\rThe leader of the human trafficking organization is none other than Roman Zelenko and he is in a rather unusual location. He is a high ranking member of the Ark society. Alongside Zelenko Marek Sinclair must also be eliminated as he is the one who will follow in Zelenko’s footsteps. When you are done a helicopter will pick you up. You can use the flair hidden in the “ark control room” to signal the helicopter. Let&apos;s put an end to this horrific operation.\r\rGood luck 47",
